Consider the following statements:
<table border="1" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="1"><tbody><tr><td><strong>a:</strong></td><td>n-Hexane on heating in the presence of anhydrous aluminium chloride and hydrogen chloride gas isomerises to branched chain alkanes. </td></tr><tr><td><strong>b:</strong></td><td>2-Methylpropane is oxidised to 2-Methylpropan-2-ol by potassium permanganate.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>c:</strong></td><td>Methane reacts with steam at 1273 K in the presence of nickel catalyst to form carbon dioxide and dihydrogen.&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table>
The correct statements are:<br>1. <strong>(a)</strong> and <strong>(b)</strong> only<br>2. <strong>(b)</strong> and <strong>(c)</strong> only<br>3. <strong>(a)</strong> and <strong>(c)</strong> only<br>4. <strong>(a)</strong>, <strong>(b)</strong> and <strong>(c)</strong>&nbsp;

Compounds that yield an aromatic compound as the major product are:
<table border="1" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="1" style="width:500px;"><tbody><tr><td>a.</td><td><a href="javascript:void(0)" id="cke_859_previewLink" onclick="return false;" target="_blank"><img alt="" id="cke_860_previewImage" src="https://d1rhszi3q7ul2h.cloudfront.net/s3buckets/neetprep-static-assets/question-assets/key__2024-08-13%2010%3A34%3A05%20%2B0000image.png" style="width: 164px; height: 80px;" title="" /></a></td></tr><tr><td>b.</td><td><a href="javascript:void(0)" id="cke_859_previewLink" onclick="return false;" target="_blank"><img alt="" id="cke_860_previewImage" src="https://d1rhszi3q7ul2h.cloudfront.net/s3buckets/neetprep-static-assets/question-assets/key__2024-08-13%2011%3A28%3A59%20%2B0000image.png" style="width: 258px; height: 110px;" title="" /></a></td></tr><tr><td>c.</td><td><img src="https://d1rhszi3q7ul2h.cloudfront.net/s3buckets/neetprep-static-assets/question-assets/key__2024-08-13%2010%3A43%3A33%20%2B0000image.png" style="width: 150px; height: 68px;" /></td></tr><tr><td>d.</td><td><img src="https://d1rhszi3q7ul2h.cloudfront.net/s3buckets/neetprep-static-assets/question-assets/key__2024-08-13%2010%3A45%3A17%20%2B0000image.png" style="width: 280px; height: 70px;" /></td></tr></tbody></table>
1. a, c<br>2. b, c<br>3. b, d<br>4. None of the above.&nbsp;
